    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Koalas will soon have a new safe home in Australia. The government has "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "come up with",
            "ref": "v-come-up-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a plan for a Great Koala National Park. They say it will help protect koalas in the wild. The park will be very big, about 476,000 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hectares",
            "zh": "公顷"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That is nearly three-quarters the size of Shanghai!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The park will "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "link",
            "ref": "v-link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " many smaller parks in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "New South Wales",
            "zh": "新南威尔士州"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". For now, cutting down trees has been banned in this area. That is important because koalas live in trees and eat only "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "eucalyptus leaves",
            "zh": "桉树叶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Without trees, they lose their food and home."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Koalas look cute and sleepy. But their life in the wild is hard. They’re "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "at risk of",
            "ref": "v-at-risk-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "extinction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Experts say koalas could "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disappear",
            "ref": "v-disappear"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by 2050 if nothing is done."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Not everyone is happy about the plan. Some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "timber",
            "zh": "木材"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " workers worry about losing jobs. The government says it will pay workers during the ban. It will also create new jobs in the park."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Nature lovers, however, are excited. They say the park can protect more than 12,000 koalas. One scientist called it “great news for koalas and for people, too”."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
